    <summary>Use your phone or tablet as a wireless drawing pad for your Windows PC screen.</summary>
    <description>Draw on your phone or tablet and see it live on your Windows PC screen. Screen Markup turns any touchscreen into a wireless drawing pad for your PC, for teaching, presenting, streaming and video calls.

**Commercial software:** free 7-day trial, then £10/year or £25 lifetime (plus VAT) from https://screenmarkup.com. Windows 10/11 (x64), main monitor.</description>
